Task 19 API versioning evidence
===============================

Gateway implementation:
- Canonical route predicates include /api/v1 via RoutePaths.versioned and rewrite only the canonical prefix before proxying.
- Legacy safe methods return 308 Permanent Redirect; mutations return 307 Temporary Redirect.
- Legacy redirects preserve query strings and emit Deprecation: true, Sunset as RFC 1123 HTTP-date, and successor-version Link.
- Default Sunset is computed as now + 90 days; VNSHOP_API_SUNSET can pin a deployment date.

